WEBVTT


00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.300
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:00:45.164 --> 00:00:47.499
Get outta my way!


00:00:47.533 --> 00:00:48.567
I called dibs!


00:00:50.502 --> 00:00:53.405
- Are those what I think they are?
- Wow!


00:00:53.439 --> 00:00:56.809
Oh, boy, I had to be late on cookie day!


00:00:56.843 --> 00:00:58.410
Cookie? Cookie? Cookie?


00:00:59.378 --> 00:01:01.313
- Here they come!
- Ah, it's crumb time!


00:01:01.347 --> 00:01:02.882
- I want a piece!
- Cookies! Cookies!


00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:05.551
They're at it already!


00:01:05.584 --> 00:01:07.518
- Out of my way! I want it!
- Hey, can I squeeze in, guys?


00:01:07.519 --> 00:01:10.089
- I've got beaks to feed!
- Snooze, you lose, Robert!


00:01:10.122 --> 00:01:11.824
- Oh...
- I want that cookie!


00:01:11.858 --> 00:01:13.259
- Hey!
- I called it!


00:01:13.292 --> 00:01:14.293
Snooze, you lose!


00:01:15.928 --> 00:01:18.330
- No touchbacks!
- Hey, no elbows!


00:01:18.364 --> 00:01:19.531
Oh!


00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.469
Aha!


00:01:23.502 --> 00:01:27.373
Come to papa! Ha! Score!


00:01:27.406 --> 00:01:30.142
- Wow!
- Yeah!


00:01:35.581 --> 00:01:38.851
Come on wings, don't fail me!
Don't want to miss it!


00:01:44.023 --> 00:01:45.224
My fellow storks.


00:01:45.257 --> 00:01:47.393
Now that we all have nested,


00:01:47.426 --> 00:01:50.329
we must concentrate on
the education of our offspring.


00:01:52.098 --> 00:01:53.399
Almost there!


00:01:53.432 --> 00:01:55.201
- The migration... Watch out!
- Whoa!


00:01:55.234 --> 00:01:58.137
- Incoming!
- Whoa! Oops! Oh!


00:01:58.170 --> 00:01:59.972
Sorry! Very late.


00:02:00.006 --> 00:02:02.942
Sparrows!


00:02:05.044 --> 00:02:07.513
Made it! Come on, cookie, let's do this.


00:02:07.546 --> 00:02:09.949
Did I miss it? Did I miss it?


00:02:09.982 --> 00:02:13.019
Don't worry, hon, you're just in time.


00:02:13.052 --> 00:02:14.420
Aw, and you brought a treat.


00:02:14.453 --> 00:02:16.522
To celebrate our new arrival!


00:02:21.093 --> 00:02:23.195
Richard, your Dad's here!


00:02:23.229 --> 00:02:27.066
Ha ha, he looks just like
I did at that age.


00:02:27.099 --> 00:02:29.668
Yeah, that's my boy.


00:02:29.701 --> 00:02:32.438
He definitely has your impatience.


00:02:32.471 --> 00:02:36.408
Looks like he's got
your pecking skills too!


00:02:36.442 --> 00:02:38.677
Come on. You can do it!


00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:40.913
Push, Richard. Push!


00:02:43.582 --> 00:02:45.617
Robert!


00:02:45.651 --> 00:02:48.087
Oh!


00:02:50.156 --> 00:02:52.191
You chose the wrong day, buddy!


00:03:26.192 --> 00:03:27.459
Oh?


00:03:38.337 --> 00:03:40.539
Ooh...


00:03:47.513 --> 00:03:49.048
Who have we here?


00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:53.285
Richard.


00:03:53.319 --> 00:03:56.322
Well, hello, Richard. I am Aurora.


00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:03.962
Shh... it's all right.


00:04:05.297 --> 00:04:06.665
Here.


00:04:09.035 --> 00:04:10.036
Mmm!


00:04:10.069 --> 00:04:13.705
That's good, isn't it?


00:04:13.739 --> 00:04:15.241
Where are your parents?


00:04:18.477 --> 00:04:20.179
Oh.


00:04:20.212 --> 00:04:21.613
Mommy!


00:04:21.647 --> 00:04:24.150
- Oh, I am not your...
- Mmm...


00:04:24.183 --> 00:04:28.020
Oh... come here.


00:04:28.054 --> 00:04:31.023
Mm... What am I gonna do with you?


00:04:41.067 --> 00:04:42.668
Hold on tight, Richard.


00:05:00.152 --> 00:05:01.420
Wow!


00:05:13.532 --> 00:05:15.767
No fish? What's in here? Frogs?


00:05:15.801 --> 00:05:17.236
No, Max, this is...


00:05:22.808 --> 00:05:25.211
Claudius, my dear.


00:05:25.244 --> 00:05:29.215
One of those pesky sparrows nearly
ruined my speech at the gathering!


00:05:29.248 --> 00:05:30.682
Mmm?


00:05:30.716 --> 00:05:33.585
Pests! What's for dinner?


00:05:33.619 --> 00:05:35.320
There is something I wanted
to talk to you about...


00:05:35.321 --> 00:05:36.555
Daddy!


00:05:36.588 --> 00:05:41.127
Aaah! Get off! Aurora!


00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:44.863
- Claudius, Max, this is...
- Get it off!


00:05:44.896 --> 00:05:47.099
- Richard!
- Off! Off, off, off!


00:05:47.133 --> 00:05:49.435
What is he doing here?


00:05:54.306 --> 00:05:56.442
He's fun! Can he stay for dinner?


00:05:56.475 --> 00:06:00.479
Certainly not.
Get this feathered leech off me!


00:06:00.512 --> 00:06:03.249
Go play with him, Max.


00:06:03.282 --> 00:06:05.484
Wanna go for a ride, Richard?


00:06:05.517 --> 00:06:07.286
- Max!
- Whoo!


00:06:16.195 --> 00:06:19.131
I found him alone in his nest.


00:06:19.165 --> 00:06:23.135
Sparrows. Stork parents
would never leave a chick!


00:06:23.169 --> 00:06:25.204
They didn't have a choice, Claudius.


00:06:25.237 --> 00:06:28.307
Their nest was... was ravaged.


00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:29.508
Oh...


00:06:29.541 --> 00:06:32.578
Still, this is none of our business.


00:06:32.611 --> 00:06:33.745
Take him back.


00:06:33.779 --> 00:06:36.448
I won't, my dear. I can't.


00:06:37.583 --> 00:06:41.253
Imagine if it was our son,
all alone in the woods.


00:06:41.287 --> 00:06:44.523
Hold on, kid. Turbulence ahead!


00:06:44.556 --> 00:06:46.325
Whoa!


00:06:46.358 --> 00:06:49.428
Where'd you go?


00:06:49.461 --> 00:06:52.264
All right. The sparrow can stay.


00:06:52.298 --> 00:06:54.433
I knew you would understand...


00:06:54.466 --> 00:06:56.835
Only... till the Fall.


00:06:56.868 --> 00:07:00.439
After that, he'll have to
look after himself. Agreed?


00:07:00.472 --> 00:07:01.840
And...


00:07:01.873 --> 00:07:04.210
I don't want the other storks
to know about this.


00:07:04.243 --> 00:07:06.312
And...


00:07:06.345 --> 00:07:08.314
he doesn't call me "Daddy".


00:07:08.347 --> 00:07:10.182
- Daddy!
- Mm?


00:07:10.216 --> 00:07:12.951
Look what I taught him!


00:07:12.984 --> 00:07:16.955
Hee, hee.


00:07:16.988 --> 00:07:19.725
Whoa!


00:07:33.239 --> 00:07:35.507
Whoa! Crazy, Max!


00:07:35.541 --> 00:07:38.877
- Can't handle it, little brother?
- Oh, I can handle it!


00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:41.680
- Ha ha.
- Faster, Max! Faster!


00:07:43.249 --> 00:07:46.352
Oh... oh... whoa!


00:07:46.385 --> 00:07:48.354
I meant that!


00:07:48.387 --> 00:07:49.721
- Sure you did!
- Whoa!


00:07:53.425 --> 00:07:55.193
Mm-hmm. But silent, okay?


00:08:02.801 --> 00:08:06.372
- I got it!
- Well done, my boy.


00:08:06.405 --> 00:08:08.440
That doesn't look so hard...


00:08:10.809 --> 00:08:12.311
Oh...


00:08:16.482 --> 00:08:17.482
Gotcha!


00:08:20.419 --> 00:08:22.288
Eeeh! Gross! Hmm.


00:08:26.057 --> 00:08:28.394
Whoa! Richard! Flying fish!


00:08:28.427 --> 00:08:30.429
- Yeah! Yeah! Yeah...
- Incoming!


00:08:30.462 --> 00:08:32.464
Ugh! I got it!


00:08:47.446 --> 00:08:50.816
Oh... oh...


00:08:50.849 --> 00:08:52.784
Nice!


00:08:52.818 --> 00:08:55.321
Hmm?


00:08:57.489 --> 00:08:59.291
Sorry, I fell out of bed.


00:09:08.634 --> 00:09:12.471
Come on, Max, I thought you were fast!


00:09:12.504 --> 00:09:14.306
Fast? I'll show you fast!


00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:17.075
Whatever you say, big brother!
I'm waiting!


00:09:17.108 --> 00:09:20.446
- I've almost got you!
- Ha ha, that's what you think!


00:09:20.479 --> 00:09:22.514
- Watch this!
- Richard!


00:09:22.548 --> 00:09:28.520
- Catch me if you can!
- The trees... they're so small!


00:09:28.554 --> 00:09:31.089
Hey! We're not allowed to go that high!


00:09:31.122 --> 00:09:33.859
Come on. Whoa!
You worry too much!


00:09:33.892 --> 00:09:37.363
No, it's too windy! Let's turn around.


00:09:37.396 --> 00:09:39.631
Chicken! A cool breeze
never hurt anyone.


00:09:39.665 --> 00:09:44.035
- Richard!
- Ah! Me and my big mouth!


00:09:44.069 --> 00:09:45.437
Gotcha!


00:09:48.374 --> 00:09:50.476
You didn't get me.


00:09:50.509 --> 00:09:52.411
- I came to you.
- Ha ha, oh, yeah?


00:09:52.444 --> 00:09:56.515
I was nose-diving, beanpole!
Good catch, though.


00:10:00.419 --> 00:10:03.689
- Dad's calling!
- Let's go!


00:10:12.097 --> 00:10:15.133
Why can't we take Richard with us?


00:10:15.166 --> 00:10:18.003
I mean, he's no burden,
and I could carry...


00:10:18.036 --> 00:10:20.506
Oh, be reasonable, Aurora.


00:10:20.539 --> 00:10:23.509
You knew this day would come.


00:10:27.012 --> 00:10:32.518
You are a wonderful mother, and
you have done all you can for him.


00:10:32.551 --> 00:10:35.721
But he won't survive
the journey to Africa.


00:10:35.754 --> 00:10:39.024
He has to live the life of a sparrow.


00:10:40.526 --> 00:10:42.894
Here we are. What's this all about?


00:10:42.928 --> 00:10:45.564
Finally! I've summoned the flock.


00:10:45.597 --> 00:10:48.567
- Come, Max.
- Hey, what about me?


00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:52.471
- I'm coming too, right?
- Hmm. Richard...


00:10:52.504 --> 00:10:55.073
Wait here until we return, all right?


00:10:55.106 --> 00:10:59.578
- What?! Why?!
- Do as you are told.


00:10:59.611 --> 00:11:01.947
- But we go everywhere together!
- Yeah, Mom!


00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:04.916
I'll explain everything
later. I promise.


00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:07.686
This is not fair!


00:11:07.719 --> 00:11:11.056
Max! Quit your lollygagging!


00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:25.036
Ahem. My fellow storks.


00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:30.208
Today, the old oak
has dropped its first leaf.


00:11:30.241 --> 00:11:33.445
The time of the great
migration has arrived.


00:11:33.479 --> 00:11:37.949
Citizens, we must migrate
before the winter comes.


00:11:37.983 --> 00:11:41.953
We will form a flock and fly south
to the Great Lake in Africa.


00:11:41.987 --> 00:11:45.123
Wow! Africa!


00:11:45.156 --> 00:11:47.626
Our journey is long and dangerous.


00:11:47.659 --> 00:11:49.728
- Oh, no no no no...
- And we...


00:11:49.761 --> 00:11:52.531
Mm?


00:11:55.801 --> 00:11:59.170
Hehe, hi there!


00:11:59.204 --> 00:12:02.574
- Richard!
- You know this bird?


00:12:02.608 --> 00:12:06.512
Know me? She's my mom!


00:12:08.179 --> 00:12:11.750
Claudius! Maybe we should
postpone our departure


00:12:11.783 --> 00:12:14.620
until your "family matters"
are resolved?


00:12:14.653 --> 00:12:17.556
My family matters are just fine.


00:12:17.589 --> 00:12:24.496
Richard, your mother... I mean,
Aurora should have told you long ago.


00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:26.197
Told me what?


00:12:26.231 --> 00:12:30.001
You are a sparrow, Richard.


00:12:30.035 --> 00:12:33.572
You cannot migrate.


00:12:33.605 --> 00:12:36.642
You belong here,
with the other sparrows.


00:12:43.582 --> 00:12:45.551
You almost had me there, Dad!


00:12:45.584 --> 00:12:48.119
You always did have such a...
Sense of humor.


00:12:48.153 --> 00:12:53.224
Haha. Hmm. Oh?


00:12:53.258 --> 00:12:55.861
Poor little thing.


00:13:00.599 --> 00:13:02.033
Come with me.


00:13:02.067 --> 00:13:04.135
I have something to show you.


00:13:04.169 --> 00:13:06.538
Hmm. Mom?


00:13:08.206 --> 00:13:09.675
Mom! What do you mean?


00:13:09.708 --> 00:13:11.677
- Wait!
- Richard!


00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:13.178
You stay here, Max.


00:13:13.211 --> 00:13:15.914
- But Dad? I...
- Stay!


00:13:15.947 --> 00:13:17.148
Our meeting is over.


00:13:17.182 --> 00:13:20.652
We shall depart at the break of dawn.


00:13:38.737 --> 00:13:40.872
Where are we?


00:13:40.906 --> 00:13:45.677
I found you here,
in this sparrow's nest.


00:13:45.711 --> 00:13:50.248
Your parents were... taken...
before you hatched.


00:13:50.281 --> 00:13:51.416
No!


00:13:51.449 --> 00:13:53.885
You're my Mom. And I'm coming with you.


00:13:53.919 --> 00:13:56.254
Richard, you can't go to Africa.


00:13:56.287 --> 00:13:58.924
I can, Mom!


00:13:58.957 --> 00:14:01.760
- It's Dad, isn't it?
- Richard, listen, we...


00:14:01.793 --> 00:14:04.796
Maybe my legs are short,
and my beak is tiny.


00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:07.132
But that's because I'm a small stork!


00:14:07.165 --> 00:14:09.701
But I'm gonna grow up to be a big stork!


00:14:09.735 --> 00:14:11.970
Big and strong! He'll see!


00:14:12.003 --> 00:14:14.139
- Wait!
- You'll all see!


00:14:17.643 --> 00:14:20.612
I can feel it, I can make it to Africa!


00:14:20.646 --> 00:14:21.513
Hmm.


00:14:21.547 --> 00:14:24.816
How hard can it be? It's not like
crossing an ocean or anything.


00:14:24.850 --> 00:14:26.818
Hurry up, you lame ducks!


00:14:26.852 --> 00:14:28.754
The Great Lake awaits!


00:14:28.787 --> 00:14:31.322
I'll show 'em how it's done!


00:14:31.356 --> 00:14:33.291
Speedy stork, coming through!


00:14:35.794 --> 00:14:36.761
Look at that little fella!


00:14:36.762 --> 00:14:39.397
With his speed, we'd be
in Africa in no time.


00:14:39.430 --> 00:14:41.833
My thoughts exactly!


00:14:41.867 --> 00:14:46.337
Ha ha! I'll just swing by to pick up
the family, then next stop, Africa!


00:14:46.371 --> 00:14:48.674
Argh!


00:14:48.707 --> 00:14:52.077
- Give him a chance, Dad!
- Do not provoke me, son.


00:14:52.110 --> 00:14:54.846
Storks could never survive the winter


00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:57.783
and sparrows could never
survive the migration.


00:14:57.816 --> 00:15:00.185
Never! That's just fact.


00:15:00.218 --> 00:15:02.353
But he can fly way better than I can!


00:15:02.387 --> 00:15:04.823
Did I not make myself clear?


00:15:04.856 --> 00:15:08.660
Sparrows are not made for
high altitudes. You know this!


00:15:08.694 --> 00:15:11.730
Richard would never
make it there alive, son.


00:15:11.763 --> 00:15:13.264
Is that what you want?


00:15:13.298 --> 00:15:17.335
I... I... Hm.


00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:22.808
- Hey, everybody! I'm home!
- Richard!


00:15:22.841 --> 00:15:25.711
- Are you all right?
- All right?


00:15:25.744 --> 00:15:28.847
Never been better!
I could fly around the world!


00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:31.449
Enough of this! Time to nest.


00:15:31.482 --> 00:15:33.151
We have a long first leg ahead of us.


00:15:33.184 --> 00:15:36.387
I can't wait!


00:15:36.421 --> 00:15:38.690
Whooo.


00:15:38.724 --> 00:15:40.225
I knew this would happen.


00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:47.899
Hey, why are you so gloomy?
We're going to Africa!


00:15:47.933 --> 00:15:50.135
Um, I guess I'm just tired.


00:15:50.168 --> 00:15:55.240
- We better crash.
- Good call.


00:15:55.273 --> 00:15:57.843
Gotta be prepped for takeoff!


00:15:57.876 --> 00:16:00.178
Am I right, big guy?


00:16:00.211 --> 00:16:01.747
Good night, beanpole.


00:16:03.749 --> 00:16:06.184
Sleep tight, little brother.


00:16:10.388 --> 00:16:12.457
Mm?


00:16:27.906 --> 00:16:32.010
Africa... Oooh.


00:16:32.043 --> 00:16:34.913
Hm.


00:16:34.946 --> 00:16:37.749
Be safe, Richard.


00:16:43.822 --> 00:16:45.791
We're running out of time.


00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:57.235
I can't believe we're doing this.


00:16:57.268 --> 00:16:59.070
It's for the best, Max.


00:17:18.824 --> 00:17:21.092
Huh? Good morning!


00:17:21.126 --> 00:17:23.862
Ready, willing and able to migrate!


00:17:23.895 --> 00:17:26.131
Let's get a move on...


00:17:29.835 --> 00:17:32.403
Mom? Dad?


00:17:35.006 --> 00:17:37.308
Max?


00:17:40.111 --> 00:17:42.848
Is that...? No!


00:17:42.881 --> 00:17:46.251
Wait! You forgot me!


00:17:46.284 --> 00:17:49.187
Wait! Wait for me!


00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:54.225
No!


00:17:59.064 --> 00:18:00.298
Come on!


00:18:23.188 --> 00:18:26.024
He looks dead.


00:18:26.057 --> 00:18:27.392
Poke him.


00:18:27.425 --> 00:18:30.461
What's that?


00:18:30.495 --> 00:18:32.964
Fine. I'll poke him.


00:18:32.998 --> 00:18:36.634
Hey, if you're not going to poke,
don't tell me how to poke.


00:18:36.667 --> 00:18:39.004
I do so know how to poke!


00:18:39.037 --> 00:18:41.139
See? Whoops.


00:18:41.172 --> 00:18:45.443
Ow.


00:18:46.544 --> 00:18:48.413
- Hmm...
- Huh?


00:18:48.446 --> 00:18:51.917
- Oooo hoo.
- Ah!


00:18:51.950 --> 00:18:55.954
Mmm?


00:18:55.987 --> 00:18:59.657
Who... who are you?


00:18:59.690 --> 00:19:03.895
I'm Olga, and this is
my best friend, Oleg.


00:19:06.064 --> 00:19:08.399
We're pygmy owls!


00:19:08.433 --> 00:19:12.037
Right... Oleg...


00:19:12.070 --> 00:19:15.606
- Um, am I in Africa?
- Mm? Mm!


00:19:24.282 --> 00:19:25.683
Want a bite?


00:19:25.716 --> 00:19:31.022
- Eww.
- More for us.


00:19:31.056 --> 00:19:34.092
Hey! Why would you think this is Africa?


00:19:34.125 --> 00:19:37.963
Oh. That's where I'm migrating
to with the other storks.


00:19:37.996 --> 00:19:41.032
At least I thought I was?


00:19:41.066 --> 00:19:43.301
Yeah, I heard him, Oleg.


00:19:45.470 --> 00:19:51.442
Eh... You do realize you are not
even close to being a stork, right?


00:19:51.476 --> 00:19:54.045
Ha! Shows what you know.


00:19:54.079 --> 00:19:56.247
My dad's leader of the flock.


00:19:58.416 --> 00:20:01.019
Sounds like Daddy issues to me.


00:20:02.487 --> 00:20:04.422
Oh, yeah, Oleg?


00:20:04.455 --> 00:20:06.958
So, why isn't he
with his flock then? Hm?


00:20:06.992 --> 00:20:11.029
Dad never believed in me.
Said I'd never make it.


00:20:11.062 --> 00:20:12.998
Oh! I see!


00:20:13.031 --> 00:20:17.068
Well, when you're not wanted,
you're better off on your own.


00:20:17.102 --> 00:20:19.504
- Right, Oleg?
- Wrong!


00:20:19.537 --> 00:20:23.008
I belong with my flock!
I'll catch up with them.


00:20:23.041 --> 00:20:26.411
And when I get there, my Dad
will see that I am a stork!


00:20:28.513 --> 00:20:30.015
You're very weird.


00:20:30.048 --> 00:20:32.683
I? I am weird?


00:20:32.717 --> 00:20:34.619
O-kay.


00:20:34.652 --> 00:20:38.189
Have fun with your...
"friend" or whatever.


00:20:38.223 --> 00:20:39.991
I'll go find my family.


00:20:41.026 --> 00:20:44.462
Hold your horses!


00:20:44.495 --> 00:20:47.098
South is that way!


00:20:47.132 --> 00:20:51.002
Pfft! Thanks, but we storks
know how to navigate.


00:20:51.036 --> 00:20:54.105
Fine! Go, stork boy!


00:20:54.139 --> 00:20:58.643
Ever seen a crazy bird like that?


00:20:58.676 --> 00:21:01.112
What do you mean, we're alike?


00:21:01.146 --> 00:21:05.183
"Not a stork"? I'll show her!


00:21:05.216 --> 00:21:06.551
Okay...


00:21:06.584 --> 00:21:09.754
They went south, and south is this way!


00:21:13.358 --> 00:21:14.359
No.


00:21:15.593 --> 00:21:17.395
No, south is that way.


00:21:20.198 --> 00:21:23.068
Uh... Or maybe this?


00:21:27.405 --> 00:21:29.607
Mom? Dad?!


00:21:31.342 --> 00:21:33.044
Hi, there.


00:21:33.078 --> 00:21:36.481
Oh!


00:21:36.514 --> 00:21:39.384
This is bad. This is really bad!


00:21:39.417 --> 00:21:41.652
Out of the way!


00:21:41.686 --> 00:21:43.054
Oh!


00:21:43.088 --> 00:21:45.556
- What are those things?
- Hungry!


00:21:45.590 --> 00:21:47.692
Follow us if you want to live!


00:21:54.465 --> 00:21:56.401
I'm right behind you.


00:21:56.434 --> 00:21:58.103
- I'm gonna catch you.
- Wait for us!


00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:02.840
Olga! Ah!


00:22:02.873 --> 00:22:05.243
Oh!


00:22:05.276 --> 00:22:06.577
Get down!


00:22:14.785 --> 00:22:17.155
I see you!


00:22:18.123 --> 00:22:19.624
Wait! I got...


00:22:19.657 --> 00:22:22.727
Oh, no, you don't!


00:22:22.760 --> 00:22:25.163
Surprise!


00:22:27.232 --> 00:22:29.167
Whoa!


00:22:30.568 --> 00:22:33.238
That won't shake them off for long.


00:22:33.271 --> 00:22:36.274
Get up, you two! He's getting away!


00:22:38.776 --> 00:22:40.145
- What now?!
- The light!


00:22:40.178 --> 00:22:42.247
We have to get closer to the light!


00:22:42.280 --> 00:22:43.548
- Got it!
- Wait!


00:22:44.849 --> 00:22:45.816
Yow!


00:22:45.850 --> 00:22:48.453
Not that close!


00:22:48.486 --> 00:22:50.488
They went over this way!


00:22:50.521 --> 00:22:51.722
Hey, bats!


00:22:51.756 --> 00:22:53.591
What are you doing?!


00:22:54.826 --> 00:22:56.761
- Hey! Let me go!
- You miss us?


00:22:56.794 --> 00:22:59.130
Looking for a tasty sparrow?


00:22:59.164 --> 00:23:00.565
- Yeah!
- Very yummy!


00:23:00.598 --> 00:23:02.400
Stork, you crazy owl!


00:23:03.634 --> 00:23:05.836
- Aah!
- Olga!


00:23:19.217 --> 00:23:23.188
Woo-hoo!


00:23:23.221 --> 00:23:26.591
Awesome!


00:23:26.624 --> 00:23:29.427
I mean... ahem.


00:23:29.460 --> 00:23:31.862
It's not like I needed any help.


00:23:31.896 --> 00:23:34.432
Mm-hmm. Right...


00:23:34.465 --> 00:23:37.502
See? This is what you get
for being nice.


00:23:37.535 --> 00:23:40.338
Big Bird here can take care of himself.


00:23:40.371 --> 00:23:42.807
Let's go chase some mice!


00:23:45.543 --> 00:23:48.546
Eh?


00:23:49.880 --> 00:23:53.651
Olga! Wait! Olga?


00:23:53.684 --> 00:23:56.354
Heh. You're still here?


00:23:56.387 --> 00:23:58.656
Oh, we thought you'd be
in Africa by now.


00:23:58.689 --> 00:24:00.791
Eh, I was thinking...


00:24:00.825 --> 00:24:05.563
Since we storks aren't nocturnal, and
you can see in the dark and all that...


00:24:05.596 --> 00:24:09.534
um, maybe you could, you know, guide me?


00:24:09.567 --> 00:24:10.968
Only until dawn, of course!


00:24:11.001 --> 00:24:14.872
Hmm. Do we look like
bird-sitters to you? No way!


00:24:17.442 --> 00:24:19.210
No, Oleg!


00:24:19.244 --> 00:24:22.480
And don't give me the evil eye!
Time to go home.


00:24:25.283 --> 00:24:28.253
Man, I hate your do-goodery!


00:24:28.286 --> 00:24:30.821
Ugh! We'll play nice.


00:24:30.855 --> 00:24:32.823
- Great, Olga!
- Thank Oleg.


00:24:32.857 --> 00:24:35.726
I'm doing this for him.
Come on, stork boy!


00:24:38.296 --> 00:24:40.265
I'm Richard, by the way.


00:24:59.484 --> 00:25:01.586
He hasn't spoken since we left.


00:25:01.619 --> 00:25:04.389
Max will grow from this.


00:25:04.422 --> 00:25:06.257
We did the right thing for Richard.


00:25:06.291 --> 00:25:09.294
I hope he's all right.


00:25:09.327 --> 00:25:11.296
Don't worry.


00:25:11.329 --> 00:25:14.299
I'm sure he's found
some sparrows by now.


00:25:31.516 --> 00:25:33.518
Huh?


00:25:34.852 --> 00:25:36.987
What?


00:25:39.357 --> 00:25:41.426
Where... where are we?


00:25:41.459 --> 00:25:44.329
What's going on?


00:25:44.362 --> 00:25:46.497
Oh, stop laughing!


00:25:46.531 --> 00:25:49.800
- Hey, Olga!
- I'm not fat!


00:25:49.834 --> 00:25:53.003
Hey, Olga! Wake up!


00:25:53.037 --> 00:25:56.307
Breathe!


00:25:56.341 --> 00:25:58.409
It's okay. Oh.


00:26:00.044 --> 00:26:02.313
- Eww!
- Nice one.


00:26:02.347 --> 00:26:04.915
- What's for breakfast?
- What was that?


00:26:04.949 --> 00:26:07.017
Never seen a pellet before?


00:26:07.051 --> 00:26:09.354
It's a little of this, little of that.


00:26:09.387 --> 00:26:10.588
You don't really wanna know.


00:26:12.022 --> 00:26:14.359
What are we doing on this thing?


00:26:14.392 --> 00:26:16.461
I belong in the air!


00:26:16.494 --> 00:26:17.962
Um, excuse me?


00:26:17.995 --> 00:26:20.097
Who had to fall asleep mid-flight?


00:26:20.130 --> 00:26:22.833
I... I... Hm.


00:26:22.867 --> 00:26:25.370
Exactly! Now chill.


00:26:25.403 --> 00:26:27.372
This thing took us further overnight


00:26:27.405 --> 00:26:28.973
than you could've ever flown.


00:26:29.006 --> 00:26:32.877
Oh, yeah? Then where's my family?


00:26:35.680 --> 00:26:37.382
If you really wanna know...


00:26:37.415 --> 00:26:39.850
What are you talking about?


00:26:39.884 --> 00:26:41.486
Just saying...


00:26:43.153 --> 00:26:45.456
They don't look anything like me.


00:26:45.490 --> 00:26:47.725
- Wow!
- Wow!


00:26:47.758 --> 00:26:51.629
- You're friends with an owl?
- Not friends!


00:26:51.662 --> 00:26:52.897
What?!


00:26:52.930 --> 00:26:56.867
Hi! I've never seen you before.


00:26:56.901 --> 00:26:59.370
A bunch of tourists just dumped
these tasty travel snacks.


00:26:59.404 --> 00:27:01.406
You guys hungry?


00:27:03.173 --> 00:27:06.477
I don't eat trash. I hunt and fish.


00:27:06.511 --> 00:27:08.913
- Oh...
- Suit yourself!


00:27:11.716 --> 00:27:14.385
- What brings you to France?
- Get this!


00:27:14.419 --> 00:27:16.987
He's going south, chasing his flock!


00:27:17.021 --> 00:27:19.890
But... we don't migrate.


00:27:19.924 --> 00:27:22.527
What kind of sparrow are you?


00:27:22.560 --> 00:27:25.530
I... I... I am a stork!


00:27:26.864 --> 00:27:29.867
- Wow. Huh?
- Hmm!


00:27:29.900 --> 00:27:31.402
Don't take it personal.


00:27:31.436 --> 00:27:34.004
He's a late bloomer.


00:27:34.038 --> 00:27:35.706
Oh...


00:27:38.709 --> 00:27:42.580
Poor things! Just wanted to say hi.


00:27:42.613 --> 00:27:46.451
No, thanks. Yeesh, so pushy!


00:27:46.484 --> 00:27:49.920
They're sparrows!
Pushy is their middle name.


00:27:49.954 --> 00:27:52.590
Can we get back to my family?


00:27:52.623 --> 00:27:55.125
Maybe we're close enough
to catch their scent by now.


00:27:55.159 --> 00:27:59.497
Talk about being pushy, right, Oleg?


00:27:59.530 --> 00:28:01.732
- Wait! You found them?
- Ooh!


00:28:01.766 --> 00:28:03.568
Go, Olga, go!


00:28:06.971 --> 00:28:08.806
Wait, this can't be right!


00:28:14.545 --> 00:28:16.814
Ah... what?


00:28:16.847 --> 00:28:19.950
Mein Hawk-Burger just flew away.


00:28:19.984 --> 00:28:23.488
What are you doing?


00:28:23.521 --> 00:28:25.656
Great, just great, Olga.


00:28:25.690 --> 00:28:27.492
My family could be
right around the corner


00:28:27.525 --> 00:28:30.495
and you're busy stuffing your beak!


00:28:30.528 --> 00:28:34.499
First things first, Oleg.
This stuff's magical!


00:28:40.938 --> 00:28:42.507
- Comment!
- Like!


00:28:42.540 --> 00:28:44.008
Huh?


00:28:44.041 --> 00:28:46.243
Fine, stay here.


00:28:46.276 --> 00:28:48.846
But, Oleg, all this delicious stuff!


00:28:51.115 --> 00:28:53.551
All right, all right!


00:28:56.020 --> 00:28:58.489
Hey, guys? Hey! Listen, you...


00:28:58.523 --> 00:29:00.491
- Aah!
- Have! You! Seen!


00:29:00.525 --> 00:29:01.692
A! Flock! Of! Storks!


00:29:01.726 --> 00:29:04.629
Aaah! Ouch!


00:29:04.662 --> 00:29:05.830
What was that?


00:29:05.863 --> 00:29:08.933
A sparrow just tried to hack me!


00:29:08.966 --> 00:29:10.835
Fail! What a troll.


00:29:10.868 --> 00:29:12.537
I'm a stork, got that?


00:29:12.570 --> 00:29:15.673
Not according to the Chick-a-pedia.


00:29:15.706 --> 00:29:18.042
- Ha ha ha. LOL!
- Like!


00:29:18.075 --> 00:29:21.812
- Hello? Someone there?!
- So, what's up?


00:29:21.846 --> 00:29:23.548
They must have fried their bird brains.


00:29:23.581 --> 00:29:25.049
Like!


00:29:25.082 --> 00:29:26.717
I'm wasting my time.


00:29:26.751 --> 00:29:29.520
Hmmm, I think I see how this works.


00:29:29.554 --> 00:29:31.956
- Love! Unfriend!
- Loading!


00:29:31.989 --> 00:29:34.659
Oh, what could possibly go wrong, Oleg?


00:29:34.692 --> 00:29:36.694
All you gotta do...


00:29:36.727 --> 00:29:37.828
Olga?!


00:29:37.862 --> 00:29:40.831
Suddenly I feel so...


00:29:40.865 --> 00:29:44.234
Connected!


00:29:44.268 --> 00:29:47.638
- Huh?
- OMG, an online owl.


00:29:47.672 --> 00:29:51.542
Olga! Can I friend you?


00:29:51.576 --> 00:29:52.909
- Me too! Me too!
- Me too! Me too!


00:29:52.910 --> 00:29:56.146
Uh... Sure! Wow!


00:29:56.180 --> 00:29:58.082
Six new friend requests already!


00:29:58.115 --> 00:30:01.552
- This is fun, Oleg!
- Ask them, Olga!


00:30:01.586 --> 00:30:03.020
Oh, oh, oh, right!


00:30:03.053 --> 00:30:06.023
Seen a flock of storks around?


00:30:06.056 --> 00:30:09.226
Storks? Non. Maybe someone else has.


00:30:09.259 --> 00:30:13.731
I'll check Facebeak.


00:30:13.764 --> 00:30:14.699
Aha!


00:30:14.732 --> 00:30:16.867
A friend of a friend
of a cousin's friend,


00:30:16.901 --> 00:30:19.336
- who I've actually blocked...
- Stalker!


00:30:19.369 --> 00:30:23.340
Says he spotted the storks
on their way to Gibraltar.


00:30:23.373 --> 00:30:25.876
Gibraltar! How do I get there?


00:30:25.910 --> 00:30:28.345
Shortest route or fewest wind farms?


00:30:28.378 --> 00:30:30.581
Never mind.


00:30:30.615 --> 00:30:32.917
I'll send Olga the coordinates...


00:30:33.951 --> 00:30:35.285
Ah!


00:30:35.319 --> 00:30:38.623
- Recalculating...
- Great! Let's go!


00:30:38.656 --> 00:30:40.190
Huh? Huh?


00:30:40.224 --> 00:30:43.861
- Olga?
- Ahh!


00:30:43.894 --> 00:30:45.362
He'll have to wait.


00:30:45.395 --> 00:30:48.265
I'm busy completing my profile!


00:30:48.298 --> 00:30:50.034
Come on, Olga!


00:30:50.067 --> 00:30:51.802
Lead the way!


00:30:54.972 --> 00:30:58.876
Just as I was getting to know her.


00:30:58.909 --> 00:31:00.878
I guess I'm back on the market.


00:31:00.911 --> 00:31:03.748
Like!


00:31:13.157 --> 00:31:17.227
Polly want a stale cracker?


00:31:17.261 --> 00:31:20.064
Because that's all you get
till you bring me customers!


00:31:20.097 --> 00:31:24.635
Sing, Kiki! Sing as if
your life depended on it!


00:31:24.669 --> 00:31:26.771
Which it does!


00:31:32.843 --> 00:31:36.781
♪ Oh, big ol' truck ♪


00:31:36.814 --> 00:31:39.083
♪ I love you best... ♪


00:31:39.116 --> 00:31:40.818
Little green waste of space!


00:31:50.160 --> 00:31:52.830
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:31:52.863 --> 00:31:55.132
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:31:55.165 --> 00:31:58.803
♪ Got to let it show, ooh! ♪


00:31:58.836 --> 00:32:00.705
♪ There's a new me coming out... ♪


00:32:03.841 --> 00:32:06.110
Oh...


00:32:06.143 --> 00:32:09.814
- ♪ Oh, big ol' truck ♪
- Cheap electronics.


00:32:09.847 --> 00:32:13.717
- ♪ I love you best... ♪
- If you don't shape up, I'm getting a cat!


00:32:15.786 --> 00:32:17.354
Mon Dieu!


00:32:17.387 --> 00:32:19.824
The Sanremo Festival begins tomorrow!


00:32:19.857 --> 00:32:22.893
<i>Attention! The express train
to Sanremo is arriving.</i>


00:32:22.927 --> 00:32:25.696
<i>It leaves immediately
after my coffee break.</i>


00:32:25.730 --> 00:32:27.364
Wait for me!


00:32:27.397 --> 00:32:29.734
I gotta get out of this prison!


00:32:29.767 --> 00:32:32.469
Help me, cracker, you're my only hope.


00:32:35.105 --> 00:32:39.009
Oh, no! I'm doomed!


00:32:39.043 --> 00:32:40.845
- OMG!
- Huh?


00:32:40.878 --> 00:32:43.914
Making friends is so much
easier than I thought!


00:32:43.948 --> 00:32:46.316
So, which way to Gibraltar?


00:32:46.350 --> 00:32:50.721
- Admit it! We're lost!
- It's not that.


00:32:50.755 --> 00:32:54.859
I have to show you.


00:32:54.892 --> 00:32:57.161
Thanks to Pigeon Maps,


00:32:57.194 --> 00:33:02.499
I got a bird's eye view on everything,
only from way up.


00:33:02.532 --> 00:33:06.804
We found you... here.
And... this...


00:33:06.837 --> 00:33:09.239
- is where you're headed.
- Africa!


00:33:09.273 --> 00:33:14.879
Totally. Thanks to Oleg and me,
we are this far already.


00:33:14.912 --> 00:33:16.747
But your storks, man?


00:33:16.781 --> 00:33:19.516
They're approaching Gibraltar over here!


00:33:19.549 --> 00:33:22.252
- That's a mighty long haul!
- So?


00:33:22.286 --> 00:33:25.389
Don't you see?
It would take us a week to get there.


00:33:25.422 --> 00:33:28.759
That's impossible!
You must've taken us the wrong way.


00:33:28.793 --> 00:33:32.262
Whoa! There's nothing
wrong with our senses.


00:33:32.296 --> 00:33:34.298
We're just not as fast as storks.


00:33:34.331 --> 00:33:36.901
And you know why?


00:33:36.934 --> 00:33:40.404
- Because we're not storks.
- That's the problem.


00:33:40.437 --> 00:33:42.973
You're not storks!
You're slowing me down.


00:33:43.007 --> 00:33:47.812
This kid is driving me bananas.


00:33:47.845 --> 00:33:50.848
There just has to be
a faster way to Gibraltar!


00:33:50.881 --> 00:33:55.552
That's my cue.


00:33:55.585 --> 00:33:58.488
Madame, monsieur?


00:33:58.522 --> 00:34:00.290
May I be of assistance?


00:34:00.324 --> 00:34:04.061
- Hmm?
- Aww! Look at you!


00:34:04.094 --> 00:34:08.966
The predator and its prey.
Need to get to Gibraltar?


00:34:08.999 --> 00:34:11.235
My name's Richard and this is Olga.


00:34:11.268 --> 00:34:16.807
- And? Ahem.
- Fine! Olga and Oleg.


00:34:16.841 --> 00:34:19.977
Quoi? Oh, I get it!


00:34:20.010 --> 00:34:22.947
- The owl's gone cuckoo.
- Cuckoo? Us?


00:34:22.980 --> 00:34:26.183
Richard's the one
who thinks he's a stork!


00:34:26.216 --> 00:34:29.586
Oh! Mmm...


00:34:29.619 --> 00:34:31.822
Of course he's a stork!


00:34:31.856 --> 00:34:35.592
The upright posture,
the inimitable elegance...


00:34:35.625 --> 00:34:37.962
- Muah!
- Finally!


00:34:37.995 --> 00:34:39.897
Someone who knows
what he's talking about.


00:34:41.631 --> 00:34:43.333
And just who are you?


00:34:43.367 --> 00:34:49.173
My apologies, Kiki La Spree,
disco parakeet fantastique!


00:34:49.206 --> 00:34:51.608
Ambassador to Sparkleville!


00:34:51.641 --> 00:34:53.443
Distinguished professor of...


00:34:53.477 --> 00:34:54.611
- Blabberbeak?
- Oh!


00:34:54.644 --> 00:34:57.547
I couldn't help but overhear
your little picking match.


00:34:57.581 --> 00:35:00.885
But don't despair.
I can get you to Gibraltar!


00:35:00.918 --> 00:35:05.555
I was headed there myself.
Isn't that an amazing coincidence?


00:35:05.589 --> 00:35:08.292
What does a cage bird want in Gibraltar?


00:35:08.325 --> 00:35:11.028
Why, I'm performing there!


00:35:11.061 --> 00:35:12.863
To welcome the migrating birds!


00:35:12.897 --> 00:35:16.000
At the... uh... Gibraltar Festival!


00:35:16.033 --> 00:35:18.568
Free me and we'll catch
a train out of here


00:35:18.602 --> 00:35:21.939
faster than you can say "Disco Duck"!


00:35:21.972 --> 00:35:23.640
But what's a... train?


00:35:25.442 --> 00:35:28.913
What the what? Ho ho!


00:35:28.946 --> 00:35:31.148
- Voilà.
- Whoa!


00:35:31.181 --> 00:35:34.051
<i>I'm halfway through my café Au lait,
so prepare to board.</i>


00:35:34.084 --> 00:35:36.420
- Oh, no! We have to hurry!
- What?


00:35:36.453 --> 00:35:40.224
He said the train to Gibraltar
is leaving tout de suite!


00:35:40.257 --> 00:35:41.926
You speak human?


00:35:41.959 --> 00:35:47.264
After a zillion hours of karaoke,
even you would, my frizzy feather ball.


00:35:47.297 --> 00:35:48.899
Makes us wonder


00:35:48.933 --> 00:35:51.035
what other tricks you've got
under your plumage.


00:35:51.068 --> 00:35:53.904
Come on, Olga!
Kiki needs our help!


00:35:53.938 --> 00:35:55.005
Merci.


00:35:55.039 --> 00:35:57.574
Now there's a lock underneath,
but be careful.


00:36:00.077 --> 00:36:02.947
- I said be careful!
- What's wrong?


00:36:02.980 --> 00:36:04.949
I am afraid of heights, all right?


00:36:04.982 --> 00:36:06.383
Help!


00:36:08.218 --> 00:36:11.055
- Oy!
- Am I dead?


00:36:11.088 --> 00:36:12.422
Not yet.


00:36:12.456 --> 00:36:15.059
I don't hear you singing!


00:36:15.092 --> 00:36:17.027
- What the...
- Olga! Get him out of here!


00:36:18.162 --> 00:36:21.531
I'm not getting my wings dirty!
You let him out!


00:36:21.565 --> 00:36:25.569
Out of my way! I've got you now!


00:36:28.172 --> 00:36:29.306
No!


00:36:30.975 --> 00:36:35.946
- Where are you taking me?
- Just keep quiet, can you?


00:36:35.980 --> 00:36:38.548
What kind of bird is afraid of flying?


00:36:38.582 --> 00:36:42.552
Flying is for the riff-raff.
I'm a songbird!


00:36:44.154 --> 00:36:47.091
Let go of me, you heartless harpy!


00:36:47.124 --> 00:36:48.625
Oh, okay.


00:36:48.658 --> 00:36:51.095
Just great!


00:36:51.128 --> 00:36:52.462
Hey, he asked me!


00:36:52.496 --> 00:36:55.132
Kiki! Just fly! You're a bird!


00:36:55.165 --> 00:36:58.102
- I can't! Aaaahh!
- Spread your wings!


00:36:58.135 --> 00:37:01.271
- Now taking my final sip...
- The train's leaving.


00:37:01.305 --> 00:37:04.141
- It's all over now.
- No!


00:37:04.174 --> 00:37:07.577
Just let me drop to my deaaaathhh...


00:37:07.611 --> 00:37:11.048
Make it stop!
Make it stop!


00:37:11.081 --> 00:37:13.083
Oh!


00:37:13.117 --> 00:37:15.252
Oh! Tulips!


00:37:19.156 --> 00:37:22.059
Great! Now I'm gonna get bird flu!


00:37:22.092 --> 00:37:24.528
- Huh?
- Help me!


00:37:24.561 --> 00:37:26.130
Birds!


00:37:31.201 --> 00:37:31.901
Oh, no!


00:37:31.935 --> 00:37:34.371
What?!


00:37:34.404 --> 00:37:36.706
That's our train over there!


00:37:36.740 --> 00:37:39.143
<i>All aboard for Sanremo!</i>


00:37:39.176 --> 00:37:42.379
Gibraltar, here we come!


00:38:09.139 --> 00:38:11.541
Dad! We can't keep going!


00:38:11.575 --> 00:38:14.044
- Everyone needs a break!
- No!


00:38:14.078 --> 00:38:15.579
We stick to the prescribed route!


00:38:15.612 --> 00:38:19.216
Can't we at least fly a little lower?


00:38:19.249 --> 00:38:22.186
No. Now keep the formation!


00:38:22.219 --> 00:38:25.589
Stay together, everyone!
Don't fall behind!


00:38:25.622 --> 00:38:28.258
- But Dad!
- Max! Do as I say!


00:38:47.277 --> 00:38:48.545
And when I woke up,


00:38:48.578 --> 00:38:51.148
my brother and my parents were...


00:38:51.181 --> 00:38:53.583
gone.


00:38:53.617 --> 00:38:56.720
I wish I had a dramatic
backstory like that.


00:38:56.753 --> 00:39:01.125
I always dreamed of escaping
my dreary surroundings


00:39:01.158 --> 00:39:04.228
to become a famous disco star!


00:39:04.261 --> 00:39:07.764
Loved... adored...


00:39:07.797 --> 00:39:10.167
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:39:10.200 --> 00:39:12.436
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:39:12.469 --> 00:39:14.538
♪ Got to let... Oh! ♪


00:39:14.571 --> 00:39:17.307
What is "disco," anyway?


00:39:17.341 --> 00:39:22.112
Some kind of courtship behavior
to attract a mate?


00:39:22.146 --> 00:39:23.313
Can be.


00:39:23.347 --> 00:39:26.716
Although I doubt you could
ever pull it off, darling.


00:39:26.750 --> 00:39:30.420
- Hmm!
- Hey!


00:39:30.454 --> 00:39:34.424
I'm used to it. I know
that I'm big and awkward.


00:39:36.293 --> 00:39:39.463
Well... didn't your mama
ever teach you to groom?


00:39:39.496 --> 00:39:42.166
Mmm...


00:39:42.199 --> 00:39:46.270
Let's just say my family
didn't exactly embrace me.


00:39:46.303 --> 00:39:49.239
Maybe with a smooth-out
and some feather-gel...


00:39:49.273 --> 00:39:51.141
Don't you see that I'm freakishly big?


00:39:51.175 --> 00:39:54.511
I've seen way bigger owls
on the Forest Channel.


00:39:54.544 --> 00:39:57.214
Yeah, but not pygmy owls.


00:39:57.247 --> 00:40:01.318
- Guess... uh... not...
- I just never fit in.


00:40:01.351 --> 00:40:04.354
- Sounds familiar.
- No!


00:40:08.958 --> 00:40:11.361
No, I literally didn't fit in.


00:40:11.395 --> 00:40:14.798
I mean, in the nest...


00:40:17.801 --> 00:40:21.605
Pygmy owls are supposed
to be tiny, not giant.


00:40:21.638 --> 00:40:23.072
A "giant pygmy"?


00:40:23.106 --> 00:40:25.709
- Is that like a "jumbo shrimp"?
- Shh!


00:40:31.581 --> 00:40:32.849
Ah!


00:40:40.657 --> 00:40:43.960
♪ Olga is a monster! Olga is a freak! ♪


00:40:53.670 --> 00:40:56.040
Oh... ohhh!


00:40:56.073 --> 00:40:59.609
My own family didn't give
a hoot about me.


00:41:07.851 --> 00:41:11.888
I didn't have a single friend
in the whole world.


00:41:14.324 --> 00:41:16.360
Mm? Mm?


00:41:16.393 --> 00:41:21.598
And then... I met Oleg.


00:41:22.799 --> 00:41:24.534
Ah!


00:41:33.410 --> 00:41:36.313
You've always been there for me.


00:41:36.346 --> 00:41:40.384
Awww... Ditto.


00:41:40.417 --> 00:41:42.786
Ahem. How can I put this?


00:41:42.819 --> 00:41:45.889
Some folks think, for someone to exist,


00:41:45.922 --> 00:41:47.724
you have to see them.


00:41:47.757 --> 00:41:50.794
It sounds kind of crazy, I know.


00:41:50.827 --> 00:41:52.362
Just leave us alone!


00:41:54.431 --> 00:41:56.300
- Nice.
- What?


00:41:59.936 --> 00:42:03.907
It's okay, Olga. I know how you feel.


00:42:05.942 --> 00:42:08.312
<i>Passengers, we will now dim the lights</i>


00:42:08.345 --> 00:42:10.547
<i>and wish you all a good night.</i>


00:42:10.580 --> 00:42:12.782
<i>We'll be in Sanremo in the morning.</i>


00:42:12.816 --> 00:42:14.384
Hmm?


00:42:14.418 --> 00:42:16.620
Uh, uh... He said...


00:42:16.653 --> 00:42:20.824
Uh, the breakfast buffet
has an omelet station


00:42:20.857 --> 00:42:22.826
and the toilet is backed up.


00:42:22.859 --> 00:42:26.430
Time for our beauty sleep!


00:42:26.463 --> 00:42:28.432
Good night!


00:42:32.035 --> 00:42:36.806
Here, hold on to me... if you want to.


00:42:44.047 --> 00:42:48.318
- Almost there.
- Uhh... Yeah.


00:42:48.352 --> 00:42:50.520
Good night, sweethearts.


00:43:17.381 --> 00:43:19.416
Don't feel guilty. Just go.


00:43:19.449 --> 00:43:23.820
Oh, I'm faker than a pair
of faux-leather stilettos.


00:43:23.853 --> 00:43:28.425
Oh, well, a diva has to do
what a diva has to do!


00:43:28.458 --> 00:43:29.458
Oh!


00:43:31.428 --> 00:43:34.531
What has she got in this thing, a piano?


00:43:34.564 --> 00:43:36.833
Oh...


00:43:36.866 --> 00:43:37.901
Kiki, we have to...


00:43:37.934 --> 00:43:39.369
- Kiki?
- Huh?!


00:43:39.403 --> 00:43:40.670
Birds!


00:43:40.704 --> 00:43:43.139
Shoo! Shoo, birds!


00:43:43.172 --> 00:43:45.542
Kiki?


00:43:45.575 --> 00:43:47.377
Kiki!


00:43:49.446 --> 00:43:51.014
Where are you?


00:43:51.047 --> 00:43:55.985
Forget him!
Let's just get outta... Here.


00:44:02.025 --> 00:44:04.528
- Well, if you saw the window, Oleg...
- Look out!


00:44:04.561 --> 00:44:06.162
Then why didn't you say something?


00:44:06.195 --> 00:44:08.598
- Oh!
- Wow. Owl coming through!


00:44:08.632 --> 00:44:10.534
Ooh!


00:44:10.567 --> 00:44:13.470
Oh! Oh, oh!


00:44:17.073 --> 00:44:20.477
Looks like you're not-a from here.


00:44:20.510 --> 00:44:23.680
Looks like-a you could use-a
some help from a local,


00:44:23.713 --> 00:44:27.784
like... Don Crowleone, sí?


00:44:27.817 --> 00:44:29.453
Well, I... eh...


00:44:29.486 --> 00:44:33.690
Hehe, I see you and it-a hit me
like a lasagna to the face!


00:44:33.723 --> 00:44:36.025
There's so many dangers
in this-a town...


00:44:36.059 --> 00:44:38.895
You gonna need-a someone
to a-look out for you, eh?


00:44:38.928 --> 00:44:40.497
Or you might run inta...


00:44:41.598 --> 00:44:44.100
Some very bad birds.


00:44:44.133 --> 00:44:45.969
- Hmm?
- So look.


00:44:46.002 --> 00:44:49.739
We protect you...
for a small-a fee, of course...


00:44:49.773 --> 00:44:53.577
so you can enjoy-a your stay in Sanremo.


00:44:53.610 --> 00:44:57.514
Huh? Sanremo? You mean Gibraltar.


00:44:57.547 --> 00:45:00.484
Scusi, Gibraltar?


00:45:02.018 --> 00:45:03.853
The bambino thinks he's in Gibraltar!
Ha ha!


00:45:05.689 --> 00:45:07.791
You're in beautiful Sanremo!


00:45:07.824 --> 00:45:09.626
- In Italia!
- W-what?


00:45:09.659 --> 00:45:13.062
Why you think-a we got-a
these-a wacky accents, ah?


00:45:13.096 --> 00:45:16.800
- Then where's Africa?
- Africa? Ha!


00:45:16.833 --> 00:45:20.604
- Way-a far away, over the sea.
- No!


00:45:20.637 --> 00:45:21.805
Don't try-a flyin' there,


00:45:21.838 --> 00:45:24.608
or you be swimmin' with the fishes.


00:45:25.742 --> 00:45:28.077
I knew that glittery green
schemer was up to no good!


00:45:28.111 --> 00:45:30.079
You mean-a the parakeet?


00:45:30.113 --> 00:45:32.081
I see him in-a big hurry.


00:45:32.115 --> 00:45:34.951
He asked-a how to get
to the Sanremo Festival.


00:45:34.984 --> 00:45:36.252
Weird little bird.


00:45:36.285 --> 00:45:38.655
Whaaaaat?! He used us!


00:45:38.688 --> 00:45:42.492
Sounds like you've been-a
had big-a-time, bambini.


00:45:42.526 --> 00:45:45.261
Hey!


00:45:45.294 --> 00:45:46.663
Richard!


00:45:46.696 --> 00:45:49.633
Shush!


00:45:51.735 --> 00:45:54.037
Wait... where are you going?


00:45:54.070 --> 00:45:56.640
How could Kiki do this?


00:45:56.673 --> 00:45:58.808
How am I going to reach my family now?


00:45:58.842 --> 00:46:01.545
No, Oleg! Hold your beak.


00:46:01.578 --> 00:46:03.547
It's time I straightened him out.


00:46:05.248 --> 00:46:08.284
You know what, Richard?
Maybe this will teach you.


00:46:08.317 --> 00:46:12.556
You're only in this mess 'cause you
won't accept what you really are.


00:46:12.589 --> 00:46:15.291
I really am totally sick
of arguing this!


00:46:15.324 --> 00:46:18.227
Fine! So then stop! Oleg, tell him!


00:46:18.261 --> 00:46:20.997
As if Oleg really existed!


00:46:21.030 --> 00:46:22.999
Leave him out of this, sparrow!


00:46:23.032 --> 00:46:26.035
Oleg's just in your head! Got it?!


00:46:26.069 --> 00:46:29.305
He's. Not. Real!


00:46:29.338 --> 00:46:31.140
La-la-la-la-la-la!
Aaah!


00:46:33.076 --> 00:46:35.879
Just great.


00:46:35.912 --> 00:46:37.681
My father had it right!


00:46:37.714 --> 00:46:40.617
Storks need to stay with their own kind.


00:46:40.650 --> 00:46:43.987
I never should've followed you. Gah!


00:46:44.020 --> 00:46:47.023
Fine! Go! Leave me!


00:46:47.056 --> 00:46:51.227
I don't need you! I don't need anyone!


00:46:51.260 --> 00:46:53.329
Oh, rats!


00:46:53.362 --> 00:46:57.000
No. I will not follow him!


00:46:57.033 --> 00:46:59.603
Ruffle your feathers
as much as you like.


00:46:59.636 --> 00:47:01.705
Whose side are you on?


00:47:01.738 --> 00:47:03.673
No, you listen, Mr. Do-gooder!


00:47:03.707 --> 00:47:06.342
Whose fault is it
that I'm in this mess, huh?


00:47:06.375 --> 00:47:09.846
You're nothing but trouble, Oleg.


00:47:09.879 --> 00:47:11.581
I wish we never met!


00:47:15.284 --> 00:47:18.622
Hm? Hm?


00:47:18.655 --> 00:47:21.057
Where did you go?


00:47:21.090 --> 00:47:23.026
Oleg?


00:47:26.663 --> 00:47:28.965
Oleg!


00:47:28.998 --> 00:47:32.636
Here! We love you!


00:47:32.669 --> 00:47:34.671
What's that fragrance?


00:47:34.704 --> 00:47:38.241
Why, it's the sweet smell
of superstardom!


00:47:38.274 --> 00:47:40.944
First prize, here I come! Huh?


00:47:40.977 --> 00:47:43.212
Who put this man-shaped mountain here?


00:47:43.246 --> 00:47:44.547
<i>Attenzione!</i>


00:47:44.580 --> 00:47:48.117
<i>All songbirds to the roof
for the Sanremo festival!</i>


00:47:48.151 --> 00:47:49.653
Oh!


00:47:49.686 --> 00:47:52.956
Why do bird events always
have to be high up?


00:47:52.989 --> 00:47:55.625
One... wing in front of the... other.


00:47:56.860 --> 00:47:59.629
Registrazione!


00:47:59.663 --> 00:48:03.132
Registrazione for the
birdsong festival here-a!


00:48:03.166 --> 00:48:06.035
It is showtime!


00:48:08.037 --> 00:48:11.407
Somebody's got to know
the way to Africa around here.


00:48:11.440 --> 00:48:13.977
Storks!


00:48:16.445 --> 00:48:17.681
Hello?


00:48:21.017 --> 00:48:22.919
Hello?


00:48:25.822 --> 00:48:28.958
Anybody home?


00:48:32.361 --> 00:48:34.163
Anybody?


00:48:43.172 --> 00:48:46.375
They must be in Africa by now.


00:48:46.409 --> 00:48:47.877
Aw...


00:48:52.381 --> 00:48:53.717
Oleg!


00:48:55.885 --> 00:48:57.721
Where are you?


00:48:57.754 --> 00:48:59.756
I didn't mean it!


00:49:00.857 --> 00:49:02.759
Come back!


00:49:05.028 --> 00:49:06.462
Post!


00:49:06.495 --> 00:49:09.699
- Share!
- Posting!


00:49:09.733 --> 00:49:12.468
You guys gotta help me!


00:49:12.501 --> 00:49:13.569
I'm looking for Oleg!


00:49:13.602 --> 00:49:17.974
I lost him. I lost Richard.
I lost all my friends.


00:49:18.007 --> 00:49:22.646
Wait! Aren't you that weirdo
owl we heard about online?


00:49:22.679 --> 00:49:24.548
The one who was chasing a sparrow


00:49:24.581 --> 00:49:27.584
- who thought he was a stork?
- Yes! That's me!


00:49:27.617 --> 00:49:29.653
Uh... except for the "weirdo part".


00:49:29.686 --> 00:49:30.554
That's-a you?


00:49:30.587 --> 00:49:33.890
You're-a trending like-a mad! Plug in.


00:49:33.923 --> 00:49:36.693
Yeah. We got-a the hi-speed cable.


00:49:36.726 --> 00:49:38.528
Um, okay.


00:49:38.562 --> 00:49:39.863
But... only for a second.


00:49:39.896 --> 00:49:41.898
Hopefully somebody's seen my friends.


00:49:43.900 --> 00:49:48.004
High speed! Life in the fast lane!


00:49:48.037 --> 00:49:49.539
Told ya!


00:49:49.573 --> 00:49:51.808
Okay, now let's find Oleg.


00:49:52.909 --> 00:49:57.180
OMG! I got 3012 friend requests?!


00:49:58.447 --> 00:50:00.900
Would you mind confirming
my friend request first?


00:50:00.902 --> 00:50:01.719
Mmm?


00:50:01.751 --> 00:50:02.485
Yeah! Mine too!


00:50:02.518 --> 00:50:07.591
Sure! I'll confirm all of them!


00:50:07.624 --> 00:50:08.825
- So many...
- Like!


00:50:08.858 --> 00:50:10.694
- New friends!
- Post!


00:50:13.630 --> 00:50:16.265
Mmm. This is it!


00:50:16.299 --> 00:50:18.635
Your magic moment!


00:50:18.668 --> 00:50:22.739
<i>Welcome to the Sanremo Festival!</i>


00:50:22.772 --> 00:50:25.274
If only I had some friends
to cheer for me.


00:50:25.308 --> 00:50:29.946
<i>And-a now we open the show
with an all-time disco classic.</i>


00:50:29.979 --> 00:50:33.349
Oh, well, the show must go on.


00:50:33.382 --> 00:50:35.585
<i>It's the parakeet
with the tweet so sweet...</i>


00:50:35.619 --> 00:50:38.087
<i>The stunningly gorgeous...</i>


00:50:38.121 --> 00:50:40.624
<i>The breathtakingly beautiful...</i>


00:50:40.657 --> 00:50:42.859
- Koko!
- Oh! What?!


00:50:42.892 --> 00:50:45.061
No, no, no! My name is...


00:50:45.094 --> 00:50:48.197
- Performers only!
- That's what I am!


00:50:48.231 --> 00:50:49.733
Oh, oh, please, please...


00:50:49.766 --> 00:50:52.135
- Oh... no!
- Oh, my!


00:50:52.168 --> 00:50:55.739
Mille grazie!
Mille grazie!


00:50:55.772 --> 00:50:58.041
- ♪ I'm... ♪
- Argh! It can't be!


00:50:58.074 --> 00:50:59.643
- I have to get up there...
- ♪ Coming ♪


00:50:59.676 --> 00:51:01.110
- Ah-ah-ah!
- ♪ Out ♪


00:51:01.144 --> 00:51:03.079
But that's my song!


00:51:03.112 --> 00:51:05.048
♪ I'm coming ♪


00:51:05.081 --> 00:51:07.316
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:51:07.350 --> 00:51:09.653
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:51:09.686 --> 00:51:12.155
♪ I got to let it show ♪


00:51:13.790 --> 00:51:15.792
♪ There's a new me coming out ♪


00:51:15.825 --> 00:51:17.727
♪ And I just had to live ♪


00:51:17.761 --> 00:51:19.295
♪ And I want to give... ♪


00:51:33.376 --> 00:51:38.682
I can do this! Hmm!


00:51:41.685 --> 00:51:44.120
♪ ...got to let it show ♪


00:51:44.153 --> 00:51:47.023
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:51:47.056 --> 00:51:49.425
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:51:49.458 --> 00:51:52.028
♪ I got to let it show ♪


00:51:55.865 --> 00:51:57.701
- Go on!
- Yeah!


00:51:57.734 --> 00:52:00.670
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:52:00.704 --> 00:52:02.672
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:52:02.706 --> 00:52:04.040
♪ Got to let it show... ♪


00:52:05.341 --> 00:52:06.876
<i>Attenzione, passengers!</i>


00:52:06.910 --> 00:52:12.148
<i>Ferry departs to Tunis, Africa, Pier 12.</i>


00:52:15.719 --> 00:52:19.288
Oh, ferry to Africa... pfft!


00:52:19.322 --> 00:52:22.959
This dreamboat's got
nothing left to twirl for.


00:52:22.992 --> 00:52:29.198
Au revoir, fame!
Bonjour, oblivion!


00:52:29.232 --> 00:52:31.868
Luigi! Everybody's at-a the cliffs!


00:52:31.901 --> 00:52:35.872
A sparrow wants to fly
across-a da sea to Africa!


00:52:35.905 --> 00:52:39.142
But-a that's-a crazy dangerous!


00:52:39.175 --> 00:52:41.711
Great! Let's-a go!


00:52:42.879 --> 00:52:45.749
Richard?


00:52:45.782 --> 00:52:48.885
Oh! I've got to stop him!


00:52:52.121 --> 00:52:56.025
Oh, I can't, I just can't!


00:52:56.059 --> 00:52:59.729
But Richard needs me! Ah! Eh!


00:52:59.763 --> 00:53:04.700
Here comes Kiki! Whoa! Whoa!


00:53:06.803 --> 00:53:10.874
Oh, no, no, no!
It'll be all right, Richard!


00:53:17.914 --> 00:53:20.750
Good job, little piggy!


00:53:21.918 --> 00:53:24.754
Olga?! Oh! Oh!


00:53:24.788 --> 00:53:28.892
For the love of Donna Summer,
what are you doing?


00:53:30.860 --> 00:53:33.296
I'm tilling my virtual farm.


00:53:33.329 --> 00:53:35.799
Leave her alone,
or I'll block-a your access!


00:53:35.832 --> 00:53:38.902
# PeskyParakeet!


00:53:38.935 --> 00:53:40.436
Oh... oh!


00:53:40.469 --> 00:53:42.772
Re-post!


00:53:47.010 --> 00:53:48.144
What have you done?


00:53:48.177 --> 00:53:50.279
Let's find another hotspot, quick!


00:53:50.313 --> 00:53:52.882
Dislike!


00:53:52.916 --> 00:53:54.450
- Richard needs our help!
- You!


00:53:54.483 --> 00:53:56.953
Why should I trust you?


00:53:56.986 --> 00:53:58.988
You tricked me once already,


00:53:59.022 --> 00:54:04.460
you deceitful, manipulative
superficial parakeet!


00:54:04.493 --> 00:54:07.063
Richard thinks he can fly
across the sea all by himself!


00:54:07.096 --> 00:54:09.498
But he'll never make it!


00:54:09.532 --> 00:54:11.868
We go to stop him!


00:54:11.901 --> 00:54:15.304
He left me, just like Oleg did.
Why should I care?


00:54:15.338 --> 00:54:17.841
Because you're friends!


00:54:17.874 --> 00:54:19.943
- Oh...
- Aw.


00:54:19.976 --> 00:54:22.812
Richard needs you. It's true.


00:54:22.846 --> 00:54:24.948
Ooh... ooh... ahh!


00:54:24.981 --> 00:54:27.951
I'll break your groove-thing


00:54:27.984 --> 00:54:29.819
if this is another one of your tricks!


00:54:29.853 --> 00:54:33.122
Eat me alive if you want! Just hurry!


00:54:33.156 --> 00:54:36.259
- Come on!
- I got you.


00:54:36.292 --> 00:54:37.827
Man, you're heavy for a parakeet.


00:54:37.861 --> 00:54:39.262
Said the giantess?


00:54:51.941 --> 00:54:53.242
Whoa!


00:54:53.276 --> 00:54:56.846
Hurry! That wacky sparrow's
a-gonna jump offa da cliff!


00:54:56.880 --> 00:55:00.383
With those-a winds?
He's-a cuckoo!


00:55:00.416 --> 00:55:02.618
I bet-a you three
herrings he goes-a splat.


00:55:02.651 --> 00:55:03.786
- Huh?
- You're on!


00:55:03.819 --> 00:55:07.290
- You can do it!
- Come on! Do it!


00:55:11.895 --> 00:55:13.362
- Jump!
- Come on!


00:55:13.396 --> 00:55:17.000
- Richard!
- Don't jump!


00:55:17.033 --> 00:55:20.003
We had a bet!


00:55:20.036 --> 00:55:21.537
Can't you see I'm busy here?


00:55:21.570 --> 00:55:23.472
No, Richard! It will kill you!


00:55:23.506 --> 00:55:26.242
- Yeah!
- Forgive me, please!


00:55:26.275 --> 00:55:29.012
I know I've been despicable.


00:55:29.045 --> 00:55:32.081
I beg you. Let me make it up to you!


00:55:32.115 --> 00:55:34.083
- Jump!
- Do it, do it, do it!


00:55:34.117 --> 00:55:37.653
I've lost Oleg already.
I can't lose you too!


00:55:37.686 --> 00:55:41.557
There's a safe way across to Africa.
A ferry!


00:55:41.590 --> 00:55:43.526
It's like a train that floats on water.


00:55:43.559 --> 00:55:45.995
No. I am a stork!


00:55:46.029 --> 00:55:47.897
Time I started acting like one.


00:55:53.069 --> 00:55:54.670
Richard!


00:55:59.943 --> 00:56:01.277
Just great.


00:56:01.310 --> 00:56:03.579
See you big boys over the rainbow!


00:56:04.747 --> 00:56:08.952
I bet-a you six herring
the green one chokes first.


00:56:12.255 --> 00:56:14.958
- Spread your wings!
- I can't! I can't!


00:56:17.126 --> 00:56:19.595
Heeeeere I cooooome!


00:56:31.340 --> 00:56:34.077
- There they go!
- Ho ho, yeah!


00:56:34.110 --> 00:56:39.082
- Pay up!
- Fine.


00:56:44.120 --> 00:56:46.055
Are we going down or up?


00:56:46.089 --> 00:56:49.025
We'll know if we crash and drown!


00:56:54.497 --> 00:56:57.133
Oh?


00:56:57.166 --> 00:56:58.634
Wow!


00:56:58.667 --> 00:57:01.004
This is amazing!


00:57:01.037 --> 00:57:04.140
Dazzle-tastic!


00:57:04.173 --> 00:57:07.610
This is definitely going in my memoirs.


00:57:07.643 --> 00:57:10.413
Too beautiful to stand!


00:57:10.446 --> 00:57:13.282
Right, Oleg? Oh.


00:57:13.316 --> 00:57:14.350
Mmm...


00:57:14.383 --> 00:57:17.987
Oh, wow...


00:57:18.021 --> 00:57:21.024
Oh...


00:57:21.057 --> 00:57:24.994
Africa, here we cooome!


00:57:39.208 --> 00:57:43.746
Look, a shooting star!
Everybody make a wish.


00:57:50.719 --> 00:57:55.158
That is no shooting star!


00:57:55.191 --> 00:57:57.493
And definitely not what I wished for!


00:58:02.365 --> 00:58:06.035
Darnit, not again.
There's something on the scope.


00:58:17.080 --> 00:58:20.083
Running on a plane
was not on my bucket list!


00:58:20.116 --> 00:58:22.818
Stay together!


00:58:25.221 --> 00:58:27.190
Olgaaaa!


00:58:34.730 --> 00:58:37.200
Where is Olga?


00:58:37.233 --> 00:58:38.734
Over there!


00:58:38.767 --> 00:58:43.439
- Olga!
- We'll save you, darling!


00:58:50.279 --> 00:58:51.847
Whoa!


00:58:51.880 --> 00:58:53.549
We have to find somewhere to land.


00:58:55.184 --> 00:58:57.720
In the middle of the sea?!


00:58:57.753 --> 00:58:59.288
There! What's that?


00:58:59.322 --> 00:59:01.424
An ocean liner!


00:59:07.130 --> 00:59:08.130
Whoo!


00:59:20.443 --> 00:59:24.280
I always wanted to learn
synchronized swimming.


00:59:24.313 --> 00:59:27.116
Olga!


00:59:27.150 --> 00:59:29.285
Darling!


00:59:29.318 --> 00:59:30.453
No!


00:59:38.227 --> 00:59:40.296
Oh!


00:59:40.329 --> 00:59:42.898
Olga! Come on! Get up!


00:59:42.931 --> 00:59:46.469
I know what to do!


00:59:48.171 --> 00:59:50.906
First aid poster.


00:59:50.939 --> 00:59:53.309
I stared at the thing for years.


00:59:53.342 --> 00:59:57.280
Come on. Olga, come on!


00:59:57.313 --> 01:00:00.549
Oh... oh...


01:00:04.320 --> 01:00:09.325
It's... too late.


01:00:09.358 --> 01:00:11.194
No.


01:00:18.501 --> 01:00:20.603
Oleg?


01:00:20.636 --> 01:00:23.339
Please...


01:00:23.372 --> 01:00:24.673
Can you help her?


01:00:27.643 --> 01:00:30.679
It's all my fault, and I'm sorry.


01:00:32.481 --> 01:00:34.783
Please bring her back!


01:00:34.817 --> 01:00:37.253
She needs you more than ever, Oleg.


01:00:53.236 --> 01:00:55.638
Ah...


01:00:55.671 --> 01:00:57.340
- Oh...
- Huh?


01:00:57.373 --> 01:01:00.276
- Oleg? Is that you?
- Ha ha!


01:01:00.309 --> 01:01:03.212
- Yes!
- All right, yes! You're back!


01:01:05.414 --> 01:01:09.352
Whoa!


01:01:09.385 --> 01:01:12.688
Eww! Oh...


01:01:12.721 --> 01:01:16.659
This is the best gift I've ever gotten!


01:01:16.692 --> 01:01:19.728
Oh...


01:01:19.762 --> 01:01:22.298
Missed you, too, Oleg.


01:01:30.473 --> 01:01:36.011
This... is the life.


01:01:36.044 --> 01:01:39.282
"Indulge yourself in our luxury spa,


01:01:39.315 --> 01:01:42.418
with 'all-you-can-heat'
sauna privileges,


01:01:42.451 --> 01:01:44.920
as we near our destination of..."


01:01:44.953 --> 01:01:46.088
Hey!


01:01:46.121 --> 01:01:50.459
You'll never guess where
we're headed, tweethearts!


01:01:50.493 --> 01:01:51.960
Africa!


01:01:51.994 --> 01:01:54.397
You can join the other storks after all!


01:01:54.430 --> 01:01:56.399
Ahem. Mm.


01:01:56.432 --> 01:01:59.001
Huh? Oh...


01:02:00.836 --> 01:02:04.707
"Other storks"?


01:02:04.740 --> 01:02:07.276
Claudius was right.


01:02:07.310 --> 01:02:10.746
You all were. I'm not a stork.


01:02:10.779 --> 01:02:13.349
I'll never be one.


01:02:13.382 --> 01:02:16.251
I'm just a sparrow.


01:02:20.923 --> 01:02:23.492
You really love them, don't you?


01:02:23.526 --> 01:02:24.993
Your storks.


01:02:25.027 --> 01:02:27.763
Mm-hmm.


01:02:27.796 --> 01:02:31.467
Then I say we show them
who you really are.


01:02:31.500 --> 01:02:35.471
But... what if they don't want me?


01:02:35.504 --> 01:02:39.308
There's only one way to find out.


01:02:39.342 --> 01:02:42.077
Are... are you sure?


01:02:42.110 --> 01:02:44.480
- Mm-hmm.
- Otherwise, I'll adopt!


01:02:44.513 --> 01:02:47.015
Oh!


01:02:49.485 --> 01:02:51.620
I just did a Gloria half-Gainer!


01:02:51.654 --> 01:02:53.489
Come on, bird of paradise.


01:02:53.522 --> 01:02:55.824
Let's find a place to sleep it off.


01:02:55.858 --> 01:02:56.959
All right.


01:02:56.992 --> 01:02:59.628
Hey, maybe there's a disco on this tub!


01:03:11.374 --> 01:03:13.376
Hmm.


01:03:16.812 --> 01:03:20.349
Storks! Prepare to land!


01:03:20.383 --> 01:03:23.652
We can rest here until the heat passes.


01:03:25.388 --> 01:03:28.491
Ahh, what a lovely death gulley!


01:03:28.524 --> 01:03:31.494
But... there was water here last year!


01:03:31.527 --> 01:03:33.061
I'm never wrong about these things!


01:03:33.095 --> 01:03:34.997
The riverbed dried up.


01:03:35.030 --> 01:03:39.502
Humans built another one
of their stupid dams.


01:03:40.569 --> 01:03:43.372
I know some other water
holes around here.


01:03:43.406 --> 01:03:45.508
I could show you, if you like.


01:03:45.541 --> 01:03:49.645
Thank you, sir, but your
assistance is not required.


01:03:49.678 --> 01:03:50.879
Hmm.


01:03:50.913 --> 01:03:54.417
Yeah? Fine. Storks!


01:03:54.450 --> 01:03:57.653
I'll go find water. Do not wander off.


01:03:57.686 --> 01:04:00.756
You could've accepted his help.
He seemed nice.


01:04:00.789 --> 01:04:03.559
Our flock can take care of itself.


01:04:03.592 --> 01:04:05.060
I know what I'm doing.


01:04:05.093 --> 01:04:08.697
Yeah... I can see that.


01:04:08.731 --> 01:04:11.166
You will not speak to me
in this way, Max!


01:04:11.199 --> 01:04:12.601
Stop it, will you?


01:04:12.635 --> 01:04:15.538
I'm only being reasonable,


01:04:15.571 --> 01:04:18.541
and doing what is best for all of us.


01:04:18.574 --> 01:04:20.108
All of us? Really?


01:04:20.142 --> 01:04:22.578
Even my little brother?!


01:04:22.611 --> 01:04:24.447
- You just don't get it!
- Max!


01:04:24.480 --> 01:04:27.182
Stay with the flock!


01:04:27.215 --> 01:04:29.952
Go after him!


01:04:29.985 --> 01:04:32.387
Max!


01:04:37.125 --> 01:04:39.595
Big mean dummy.


01:04:39.628 --> 01:04:41.864
Jerk.


01:04:41.897 --> 01:04:43.632
It's a dangerous place!


01:04:43.666 --> 01:04:45.434
I hate you!


01:04:46.969 --> 01:04:49.104
Oh? Oh!


01:04:55.110 --> 01:04:57.646
He-hello?


01:04:57.680 --> 01:04:58.914
Who's there...


01:05:02.618 --> 01:05:05.454
Max? My boy?


01:05:11.494 --> 01:05:13.829
I can't believe we're in Tangier!


01:05:15.598 --> 01:05:17.733
Africa!


01:05:19.535 --> 01:05:21.136
Hot stuff! Ooh, baby!


01:05:21.169 --> 01:05:23.171
Which way to the Great Lake, Olga?


01:05:23.205 --> 01:05:25.508
Hm... let's see.


01:05:25.541 --> 01:05:26.475
Richard!


01:05:26.509 --> 01:05:28.844
You're that sparrow
who thinks he's a stork!


01:05:28.877 --> 01:05:30.846
We have some good news for you.


01:05:30.879 --> 01:05:33.148
- Your flock is nearby!
- Oh!


01:05:33.181 --> 01:05:35.117
Just in!


01:05:35.150 --> 01:05:36.985
They're, like, totally in trouble!


01:05:37.019 --> 01:05:39.655
A-something about
the Flock Leader's son...


01:05:39.688 --> 01:05:41.156
"Wax"?


01:05:41.189 --> 01:05:42.525
Max!


01:05:42.558 --> 01:05:43.425
That's the one!


01:05:43.458 --> 01:05:46.161
He vanished without a trace.


01:05:46.194 --> 01:05:48.263
- By the oasis.
- Oasis?


01:05:48.296 --> 01:05:49.765
I need to get there now!


01:05:49.798 --> 01:05:52.167
Er, maybe we could take him, darling.


01:05:52.200 --> 01:05:55.838
- It's not that far.
- What?! Get offline?!


01:05:55.871 --> 01:05:57.706
Did you catch a virus?


01:05:57.740 --> 01:05:59.542
Come on! Hurry! Please!


01:05:59.575 --> 01:06:01.977
We got to help him, snookums!


01:06:04.547 --> 01:06:06.882
Hey! This is better than I remembered!


01:06:06.915 --> 01:06:08.717
Come, my lovebird!


01:06:08.751 --> 01:06:11.620
Never! I'll miss a personality quiz!


01:06:11.654 --> 01:06:13.221
- Whoa!
- Trust me.


01:06:13.255 --> 01:06:14.890
You don't want to miss this.


01:06:19.227 --> 01:06:22.731
Everything's so... real!


01:06:22.765 --> 01:06:24.900
- Hurry! To the oasis!
- Love!


01:06:24.933 --> 01:06:29.672
Oh, well! There goes my vacation.


01:06:29.705 --> 01:06:31.674
Oh, I wish I'd brought my sunglasses!


01:06:35.277 --> 01:06:37.680
Max!


01:06:37.713 --> 01:06:41.684
Max!


01:06:41.717 --> 01:06:45.621
It's impossible!


01:06:45.654 --> 01:06:47.556
If only that boy had listened to me...


01:06:47.590 --> 01:06:49.858
- What are we going to do?
- I don't know what else...


01:06:49.892 --> 01:06:51.794
Where is Max?!


01:06:55.030 --> 01:06:57.332
Richard?


01:06:57.365 --> 01:06:59.702
How... how can that be?


01:06:59.735 --> 01:07:02.705
Mom! What happened to Max?


01:07:02.738 --> 01:07:03.772
He ran away.


01:07:03.806 --> 01:07:05.641
And... and we found his footsteps,


01:07:05.674 --> 01:07:07.242
leading into this tunnel.


01:07:07.275 --> 01:07:10.012
I tried everything,
but I couldn't get in.


01:07:10.045 --> 01:07:12.915
Not good... Not good at all.


01:07:12.948 --> 01:07:16.885
This is the entrance to the honey
badger's underground lair.


01:07:16.919 --> 01:07:19.788
Honey badger doesn't
sound so bad, right?


01:07:19.822 --> 01:07:21.624
Yeah! I'm gonna get Max out of there.


01:07:21.657 --> 01:07:22.791
Oh, no!


01:07:22.825 --> 01:07:25.894
The honey badger's the most
fearless predator of all.


01:07:25.928 --> 01:07:29.197
Instant death is pretty much a given.


01:07:29.231 --> 01:07:32.735
- Uh-huh? How would you know?
- Basic cable.


01:07:32.768 --> 01:07:34.803
- Ah.
- Okay, I'm going in.


01:07:34.837 --> 01:07:36.939
No! It's too dangerous for you...


01:07:36.972 --> 01:07:38.607
We have no other choice!


01:07:38.641 --> 01:07:41.143
You storks don't fit
through that entrance.


01:07:41.176 --> 01:07:42.745
We're coming with you!


01:07:42.778 --> 01:07:46.114
We'll show this badger
some honey, right, Kiki?


01:07:46.148 --> 01:07:47.816
Right, Kiki?!


01:07:47.850 --> 01:07:51.787
Remind me again why I'm signing
up for this kamikaze mission?


01:07:53.021 --> 01:07:55.658
Because you tricked us and you feel bad.


01:07:55.691 --> 01:07:58.326
Oh. Yeah. Count me in.


01:07:59.828 --> 01:08:01.764
- Richard!
- What?!


01:08:01.797 --> 01:08:07.402
Be careful. Please.


01:08:07.435 --> 01:08:08.771
Hmm.


01:08:14.342 --> 01:08:16.779
I'll guard the entrance!


01:08:25.688 --> 01:08:27.756
Oh, this was a bad idea.


01:08:30.358 --> 01:08:31.860
And I know bad ideas.


01:08:31.894 --> 01:08:33.862
"Bad idea" is my middle name!


01:08:33.896 --> 01:08:36.131
Shh!


01:08:37.399 --> 01:08:39.768
I'm a disco-lover, not a badger-fighter!


01:08:39.802 --> 01:08:41.870
Oh!


01:08:43.205 --> 01:08:44.740
He must be this way.


01:08:44.773 --> 01:08:48.376
Good. So let's go...


01:08:48.410 --> 01:08:49.678
that way.


01:08:49.712 --> 01:08:50.813
Okay, okay!


01:08:54.016 --> 01:08:56.685
That's slightly creepy.


01:08:56.719 --> 01:09:00.723
Is that... Max?


01:09:00.756 --> 01:09:03.726
That look like bird bones to you?


01:09:03.759 --> 01:09:06.962
How should I know? I'm vegan.


01:09:06.995 --> 01:09:09.998
And I'm a meat-eater. Remember that.


01:09:15.003 --> 01:09:17.873
So, ah, you guys give any more thought


01:09:17.906 --> 01:09:20.142
to my "running away" idea?


01:09:20.175 --> 01:09:23.411
Everyone, take a tunnel.
But be silent, okay?


01:09:24.847 --> 01:09:26.681
That means you, Showtune.


01:09:28.016 --> 01:09:30.018
- Hey!
- Shh!


01:09:30.052 --> 01:09:31.219
Take your tunnel!


01:09:31.253 --> 01:09:33.922
Can't we at least flip a coin?


01:09:33.956 --> 01:09:35.157
Shake a tailfeather!


01:09:36.759 --> 01:09:39.962
Well, at least I'll leave
a gorgeous corpse.


01:09:43.866 --> 01:09:45.768
Max?


01:09:48.904 --> 01:09:49.904
Max?


01:10:03.485 --> 01:10:04.887
Hmm.


01:10:07.956 --> 01:10:09.257
Mmm, hearty crunch.


01:10:09.291 --> 01:10:12.260
With a delightfully gooey center.


01:10:12.294 --> 01:10:14.296
Max?


01:10:14.329 --> 01:10:16.031
Whoa!


01:10:30.278 --> 01:10:32.380
Max!


01:10:32.414 --> 01:10:34.116
Is he okay?


01:10:34.149 --> 01:10:35.918
Phew!


01:10:37.585 --> 01:10:41.089
- Get up, Max!
- Oh.


01:10:41.123 --> 01:10:44.893
Oh? Little brother?


01:10:44.927 --> 01:10:47.930
Oh! How did you... get here?


01:10:47.963 --> 01:10:51.834
Shh! We've gotta get you out of here.


01:10:51.867 --> 01:10:52.935
Where's Kiki?


01:10:52.968 --> 01:10:55.971
Oh, great.


01:10:56.004 --> 01:10:59.174
My dry-cleaning bill is
going to be astronomical!


01:11:05.047 --> 01:11:06.915
I'm seeing double. Triple. Quadruple!


01:11:10.618 --> 01:11:14.990
Running away! Running away!


01:11:18.861 --> 01:11:20.896
- It's him!
- Ooops! Sorry.


01:11:20.929 --> 01:11:21.897
Great.


01:11:21.930 --> 01:11:23.198
This way out!


01:11:25.033 --> 01:11:26.902
Which tunnel?


01:11:28.871 --> 01:11:29.905
This one looks good!


01:11:32.340 --> 01:11:33.976
Kiki!


01:11:37.012 --> 01:11:39.481
I'm too colorful to die!


01:11:48.490 --> 01:11:50.192
Oh!


01:11:53.428 --> 01:11:56.064
♪ Monsieur Honey Badger! ♪


01:11:56.098 --> 01:11:57.098
Huh?


01:11:58.333 --> 01:12:00.969
♪ There's a new me coming out ♪


01:12:01.003 --> 01:12:03.038
♪ And I just had to live ♪


01:12:03.071 --> 01:12:04.907
♪ And I wanna give ♪


01:12:04.940 --> 01:12:07.042
♪ I'm completely positive ♪


01:12:07.075 --> 01:12:09.011
♪ I think this time around ♪


01:12:09.044 --> 01:12:11.013
♪ I am gonna do it ♪


01:12:11.046 --> 01:12:13.381
♪ Like you never knew it ♪


01:12:13.415 --> 01:12:15.884
♪ Ooh, I'll make it through ♪


01:12:15.918 --> 01:12:17.038
♪ The time has come for me ♪


01:12:17.052 --> 01:12:18.987
♪ To break out of this shell ♪


01:12:19.021 --> 01:12:21.389
♪ I have to shout ♪


01:12:21.423 --> 01:12:22.991
♪ I am coming out ♪


01:12:23.025 --> 01:12:24.559
Huh?


01:12:29.364 --> 01:12:31.934
Olga, Kiki! Get Max out of here!


01:12:31.967 --> 01:12:33.168
But what about you?


01:12:33.201 --> 01:12:34.469
Just do it!


01:12:39.607 --> 01:12:41.676
- Just my luck.
- A dead end?


01:12:41.709 --> 01:12:44.346
Everybody, keep looking!


01:12:44.379 --> 01:12:47.082
There must be another way to get in!


01:12:47.115 --> 01:12:49.217
- Huh?
- Dad! Mom!


01:12:49.251 --> 01:12:51.053
- We're here!
- Max!


01:12:51.086 --> 01:12:52.654
Dig here!


01:12:56.591 --> 01:12:59.194
Ahh! Beaks!


01:12:59.227 --> 01:13:02.564
- Ah!
- Ouch!


01:13:04.099 --> 01:13:06.301
Son! Oh!


01:13:06.334 --> 01:13:08.103
I'm so sorry.


01:13:08.136 --> 01:13:09.604
Dad! Richard's still in there.


01:13:09.637 --> 01:13:10.705
No!


01:13:22.750 --> 01:13:24.086
Ah!


01:13:25.487 --> 01:13:26.989
Richard! Get out of there!


01:13:33.996 --> 01:13:36.398
Don't you touch him, you beast!


01:13:42.670 --> 01:13:46.041
- It's collapsing!
- That cave wasn't up to code!


01:13:49.611 --> 01:13:51.013
Oh!


01:13:51.046 --> 01:13:53.982
Here, honey bunny!


01:13:54.016 --> 01:13:56.518
Looking for a tasty sparrow?


01:14:09.031 --> 01:14:10.999
Oh!


01:14:34.656 --> 01:14:36.324
Richard!


01:14:36.358 --> 01:14:38.360
Where... where is he?


01:14:39.827 --> 01:14:41.529
- Richard?
- Come on out!


01:14:44.066 --> 01:14:47.069
Can you see him, Oleg?


01:14:47.102 --> 01:14:49.304
Oh, no.


01:15:02.684 --> 01:15:05.420
Huh?


01:15:07.622 --> 01:15:09.724
Do you see what I see?


01:15:09.757 --> 01:15:11.593
What?


01:15:15.563 --> 01:15:17.132
Richard!


01:15:17.165 --> 01:15:19.367
- Oh!
- It's Richard!


01:15:19.401 --> 01:15:20.535
Yeah! Ha ha!


01:15:20.568 --> 01:15:21.769
What?


01:15:26.741 --> 01:15:28.843
Just in time, little brother.


01:15:28.876 --> 01:15:33.148
Oh, you sure know
how to make an entrance.


01:15:34.582 --> 01:15:37.419
Oh... I'll never let you go again!


01:15:40.122 --> 01:15:41.723
How did you ever get here?


01:15:41.756 --> 01:15:44.692
Everybody, these are my friends,


01:15:44.726 --> 01:15:46.628
- Olga and Kiki...
- Ahem.


01:15:46.661 --> 01:15:49.231
And Oleg.


01:15:49.264 --> 01:15:50.731
I wouldn't be here
if it wasn't for them.


01:15:50.732 --> 01:15:53.135
Enchanté!


01:15:53.168 --> 01:15:55.870
It was our pleasure, right, Oleg?


01:16:00.142 --> 01:16:03.177
I owe you an apology, Richard.


01:16:04.912 --> 01:16:07.615
I should have believed in you.


01:16:07.649 --> 01:16:12.086
Sparrow or stork... you are my son.


01:16:18.860 --> 01:16:22.230
I... I can be part of the family?


01:16:22.264 --> 01:16:24.899
Nothing would make me prouder.


01:16:31.273 --> 01:16:32.640
Mmm.


01:16:32.674 --> 01:16:34.509
Aww!


01:16:36.878 --> 01:16:39.681
Next stop, the Great Lake!


01:16:39.714 --> 01:16:41.916
Richard...


01:16:41.949 --> 01:16:44.152
would you lead us?


01:16:44.186 --> 01:16:46.288
Really?! Me?


01:16:46.321 --> 01:16:50.425
When you're ready, give the signal.


01:16:50.458 --> 01:16:52.327
Hey, Richard?


01:16:52.360 --> 01:16:55.297
South is that way!


01:17:01.236 --> 01:17:04.439
Follow me!


01:17:04.472 --> 01:17:06.208
Wait for us!


01:17:06.241 --> 01:17:08.610
We're not all storks, you know!


01:17:08.643 --> 01:17:10.945
Come on, everyone! Keep the pace!


01:17:10.978 --> 01:17:14.316
Jeez, little brother!
Been training?


01:17:17.285 --> 01:17:19.721
Ah...


01:17:29.831 --> 01:17:32.200
Whoa! That must be it!


01:17:32.234 --> 01:17:36.338
Yeah! The Great Lake!


01:17:39.541 --> 01:17:43.478
Ooh! Now that's what I call
a deluxe resort!


01:17:43.511 --> 01:17:46.548
Thanks, Oleg.


01:17:46.581 --> 01:17:48.850
I couldn't have done it without you.


01:17:50.418 --> 01:17:53.488
We did it. We really did it!


01:17:53.521 --> 01:17:56.858
Woo-hoo!


01:17:56.891 --> 01:18:01.763
Come on, guys! Yeah!

